     "text": "WHEN: Your opponent’s Shooting phase, when an enemy unit that targeted a friendly unengaged EMPEROR’S CHILDREN CHARACTER unit this phase has shot.\nTARGET: That EMPEROR’S CHILDREN CHARACTER unit.\nEFFECT: Your unit can make a surge move of up to D6\". If your unit is not your army’s Favoured Champions, you can re-roll the dice to determine the distance of that surge move."
